  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive)</p>\n<p><strong>Mods:</strong> All Bows/Crossbows, Pistols, SMGs, and Shotguns without a Smart Rebuild</p>\n<p><em>Tiny bits of radioactive material can be helpful, if applied correctly; such as to the iron sights of a sidearm, improving close-range accuracy.</em></p>\n<p>When making a Single Shot Attack on a target within 0-12m/yds and wielding the weapon in two hands, the user gains a +1 bonus to their Attack Check. For One-Handed Ranged Weapons, this does not cause the weapon to require two hands to be wielded, only that it requires such for the Attack Check bonus to apply. This does not stack with the bonus provided by the Short Scope attachment.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0 (Weapon Mod)</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>For bows, crossbows, pistols, SMGs, and shotguns without a Smart Rebuild: +1 to Single Shot attacks at 0-12m/yds while held two-handed (situational); One-Handed weapons don't become Two-Handed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Weapon Mods).</em></p>"
